<section class="premium-page" style="padding: 120px 0 80px; min-height: 70vh; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 800px; width: 100%;">
    
    <div class="glass-panel leak-top-pink" style="padding: 60px 40px; position: relative; border-radius: 16px;">
      <div class="brickwall" style="opacity: 0.1;"></div>
      
      <div style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--heading); color: var(--ivory); font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 48px); margin: 0 0 32px; line-height: 1.1; text-align: center;">{{ page.title }}</h1>
        
        <div class="rte" style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;">
          {% assign p_handle = page.handle %}
          
          {% if p_handle contains 'faq' %}
            <h3 style="color: var(--cyan); margin-top: 30px;">How long does shipping take?</h3>
            <p>Orders are handcrafted in Hyderabad and typically take 5-7 business days to process before shipping.</p>
            
            <h3 style="color: var(--cyan); margin-top: 30px;">How do I install my sign?</h3>
            <p>Every sign comes with a free mounting kit. It's as easy as hanging a picture frame, just drill, screw the mounts, and plug it in!</p>
            
            <h3 style="color: var(--cyan); margin-top: 30px;">What is the warranty?</h3>
            <p>We offer a 2-year warranty on all electrical components. If your sign malfunctions under normal use, we will replace the faulty parts free of charge.</p>
            
            <h3 style="color: var(--cyan); margin-top: 30px;">Can I use my sign outdoors?</h3>
            <p>Our standard signs are designed for indoor use. If you need an outdoor waterproof sign, please mention this when contacting our team for a custom order!</p>
            
            {% if page.content != blank and page.content != '<p></p>' %}{{ page.content }}{% endif %}
          
          {% elsif p_handle contains 'story' or p_handle contains 'about' %}
            <p>We are <strong>Neon Adda</strong>, born in Hyderabad with a passion for bringing spaces to life with vibrant, custom neon artwork.</p>
            <p>Every sign we create is meticulously handcrafted using premium LED flex, ensuring durability, brightness, and absolute safety for your home, office, or business.</p>
            <p>Whether it's a personalized quote for your bedroom, or a massive glowing logo for your storefront, our team is dedicated to illuminating your vision with unmatched craftsmanship and care.</p>
            
            {% if page.content != blank and page.content != '<p></p>' %}{{ page.content }}{% endif %}
          
          {% elsif p_handle contains 'why' or p_handle contains 'shipping' or p_handle contains 'warranty' or p_handle contains 'returns' %}
            <h2 style="color: var(--ivory); font-family: var(--heading); font-size: 32px; margin-top: 40px;">Shipping &amp; Returns</h2>
            <p>We proudly ship all over India. Each sign is securely packaged in custom-cut foam and heavy-duty boxes to prevent damage during transit. If your sign arrives damaged, please take photos and contact us within 48 hours for an immediate replacement.</p>
            <p>Because all our signs are custom-made to order, we do not accept returns or refunds for changes of mind. However, your satisfaction is our priority—if there is a manufacturing defect, we will fix it.</p>
            
            <h2 style="color: var(--ivory); font-family: var(--heading); font-size: 32px; margin-top: 40px;">Warranty Information</h2>
            <p>We stand by our craftsmanship. All our neon signs come with a 2-year warranty covering electrical failures such as the power adapter, dimmer, or internal wiring. (Note: Warranty does not cover physical damage caused after delivery or improper installation).</p>
            
            {% if page.content != blank and page.content != '<p></p>' %}{{ page.content }}{% endif %}

          {% elsif p_handle contains 'contact' or p_handle contains 'location' %}
            <h3 style="color: var(--cyan); margin-top: 30px;">Get in Touch</h3>
            <p>We're here to discuss your custom neon sign and bring your ideas to life with premium craftsmanship.</p>
            <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
              <li style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong style="color:var(--ivory);">Email:</strong> neonadda.hyd@gmail.com</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong style="color:var(--ivory);">Phone:</strong> +91 70958 44495 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;+91 89786 01154</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong style="color:var(--ivory);">Location:</strong> 1St Floor, RK Towers, Opp. Asian Grammer School,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bahadurpura x roads, Hyderabad.</li>
            </ul>
            
            {% if page.content != blank and page.content != '<p></p>' %}{{ page.content }}{% endif %}
          
          {% else %}
            {% if page.content != blank %}
              {{ page.content }}
            {% else %}
              <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--muted-2);">Content coming soon.</p>
            {% endif %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .rte h1, .rte h2, .rte h3 {
    font-family: var(--heading);
    color: var(--ivory);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .rte h2 { font-size: 32px; }
  .rte h3 { font-size: 24px; color: var(--cyan); }
  .rte p {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .rte ul {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .rte li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .rte a {
    color: var(--pink);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Default Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
